===Post-election changes===
Two Democrats resigned and were replaced by appointees. In Texas, a [[1993 United States Senate special election in Texas|1993 special election]] was held prior to the [[1994 United States Senate elections]], where Kay Bailey Hutchison won the special election to succeed Democratic appointee Bob Krueger, who lost election to finish the term.
